mb|?|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|It is not clear what West should bid. 4@H is probably the bid with the most upside. That is the purpose of preempting. The opponents have to guess what to do.|
