mb|P?|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|At "favorable vulnerability" (your side is not vul, their side is vul) you want to strain to preempt and often preempt one higher than you normally would. So despite my very weak hand, this is a clear 3@C preempt at favorable vulnerability.|
