mb|3C|mb|D|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|mb|4C|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|A good |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=lott,Law of Total Tricks^*N|CP||FP||at| bid by North.|
PG| ***** 89 ***** |


mb|P|mb|P|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|mb|D|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Again that is not a penalty double per se. It is just value showing. It shows that West has much more than a minimum takeout double hand.|
PG| ***** 90 ***** |


mb|P?|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Now East must ^*BDo Something Intelligent^*n. On this hand, with no defense and 5 diamonds and a singleton club 4@D is the best bid. And as you can see, the preempt made it difficult for EW to bid accurately. for them 4@H is clearly the place to play.|
